#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<i>A historic double secured in 2002, and a dramatic penalty-shootout "
"victory in 2019.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>ຄວ້າສອງແຊ້ມປະຫວັດສາດໃນປີ 2002 ແລະ ໄຊຊະນະຈາກການດວນຈຸດໂທດສຸດຕື່ນເຕັ້ນໃນປີ 2019.</i>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<i>A thrilling 3-2 victory against our fiercest rivals FC SAP, to kick off "
"the new decade in style.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>ໄຊຊະນະ 3-2 ສຸດຕື່ນເຕັ້ນຕໍ່ຄູ່ປັບຕະຫຼອດການ FC SAP ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທົດສະວັດໃໝ່ຢ່າງສະຫງ່າງາມ.</i>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<i>Awarded to our captain for an outstanding campaign of 22 goals and 15 "
"assists.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>ມອບໃຫ້ຫົວໜ້າທີມຂອງພວກເຮົາ ສຳລັບຜົນງານອັນໂດດເດັ່ນ ຍິງ 22 ປະຕູ ແລະ ສົ່ງໃຫ້ເພື່ອນຍິງ 15 ຄັ້ງ.</i>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<i>Honoring tactical excellence and leadership after our historic unbeaten "
"league run.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>ເຊີດຊູຄວາມເປັນເລີດດ້ານແຜນການຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ຄວາມເປັນຜູ້ນຳ "
"ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງສະຖິຕິບໍ່ເສຍໄຊຕະຫຼອດລະດູການປະຫວັດສາດ.</i>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<i>Inaugural win in 2002, followed by back-to-back dominant seasons in 2015 "
"and 2016.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>ຄວ້າແຊ້ມຄັ້ງທຳອິດໃນປີ 2002 ຕາມດ້ວຍການຄອງແຊ້ມສອງລະດູການຕິດຕໍ່ກັນໃນປີ 2015 ແລະ 2016.</i>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<i>Recognizing the league's top goalscorer wearing the legendary black and "
"gold jersey.</i>"
msgstr "<i>ເຊີດຊູດາວຍິງສູງສຸດຂອງລີກ ທີ່ສວມເສື້ອສີດຳ-ຄຳ ລະດັບຕຳນານ.</i>"

