msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ CRM</b>: </strong>ຍົກລະດັບການຈັດຫາທຶນໃຫ້ເປັນມືອາຊີບ "
"ໂດຍການຕິດຕາມຜູ້ສະໜັບສະໜູນທີ່ມີທ່າແຮງ ແລະ ຈັດການ\n"
"                    ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງການສະໜັບສະໜູນຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິຜົນ.<br/>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Events App</b>: </strong>Engage your fanbase by selling match "
"tickets and managing registrations\n"
"                    for tournaments or social events online.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ Events</b>: </strong>ສ້າງການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມກັບແຟນບານ "
"ດ້ວຍການຂາຍປີ້ເຂົ້າຊົມການແຂ່ງຂັນ ແລະ ຈັດການການລົງທະບຽນ\n"
"                    ສຳລັບການແຂ່ງຂັນ ຫຼື ງານກິດຈະກຳຕ່າງໆ ທາງອອນລາຍ.<br/>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Invoicing App</b>: </strong>Keep the club's finances healthy by "
"invoicing members and sponsors\n"
"                    and tracking incoming payments.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ Invoicing</b>: </strong>ຮັກສາສະຖານະການເງິນຂອງສະໂມສອນໃຫ້ເຂັ້ມແຂງ "
"ໂດຍການອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນໃຫ້ສະມາຊິກ ແລະ ຜູ້ສະໜັບສະໜູນ\n"
"                    ພ້ອມທັງຕິດຕາມການຊຳລະເງິນທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ.<br/>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Planning App</b>: </strong>Optimize your facilities by scheduling "
"field and court bookings to\n"
"                    prevent conflicts between teams.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ Planning</b>: </strong>ຈັດສັນການໃຊ້ງານສະໜາມໃຫ້ເກີດປະໂຫຍດສູງສຸດ "
"ໂດຍການວາງຕາຕະລາງຈອງສະໜາມ\n"
"                    ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນເວລາຊ້ອນກັນລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະທີມ.<br/>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Point of Sale App</b>: </strong>Run your club's bar or "
"merchandise shop efficiently, handling\n"
"                    sales of drinks, snacks, and team jerseys.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ Point of Sale</b>: </strong>ດຳເນີນງານບາ ຫຼື "
"ຮ້ານຂາຍເຄື່ອງທີ່ລະນຶກຂອງສະໂມສອນຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ຈັດການ\n"
"                    ການຂາຍເຄື່ອງດື່ມ, ອາຫານຫວ່າງ ແລະ ເສື້ອທີມ.<br/>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Project App</b>: </strong>Coordinate complex activities like "
"player recruitment drives and trial\n"
"                    days with clear tasks and timelines.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ Project</b>: </strong>ປະສານງານກິດຈະກຳທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການເປີດຮັບສະໝັກນັກເຕະ ແລະ ວັນຄັດເລືອກຕົວ\n"
"                    ດ້ວຍໜ້າວຽກ ແລະ ກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ຊັດເຈນ.<br/>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Sales App</b>: </strong>Generate professional sponsorship offers "
"and formal contribution requests\n"
"                    to secure revenue.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ Sales</b>: </strong>ສ້າງຂໍ້ສະເໜີການສະໜັບສະໜູນແບບມືອາຊີບ ແລະ "
"ໜັງສືຮຽກເກັບເງິນປະກອບສ່ວນຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ\n"
"                    ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍຮັບທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງ.<br/>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Teams App</b>: </strong>Organize your club's structure by "
"managing rosters, assigning players to\n"
"                    specific squads, and tracking team compositions.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ Teams</b>: </strong>ຈັດລະບຽບໂຄງສ້າງສະໂມສອນ "
"ໂດຍການຈັດການລາຍຊື່ນັກເຕະ, ແບ່ງນັກເຕະເຂົ້າ\n"
"                    ແຕ່ລະຊຸດ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໂຄງສ້າງຂອງທີມ.<br/>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Website App</b>: </strong>Build a digital home for your club to "
"showcase team profiles, sell\n"
"                    merchandise, and manage online enrollments.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ Website</b>: </strong>ສ້າງເວັບໄຊຫຼັກຂອງສະໂມສອນ ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທີມ, "
"ຂາຍສິນຄ້າ\n"
"                    ແລະ ຈັດການການລົງທະບຽນອອນລາຍ.<br/>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Dashboards</strong> to monitor sponsorship revenue, ticket sales, "
"recruitment pipeline, and bookings."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ກະດານສະຫຼຸບຂໍ້ມູນ (Dashboards)</strong> ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມລາຍຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ, "
"ຍອດຂາຍປີ້, ຂັ້ນຕອນການຮັບສະໝັກນັກເຕະ ແລະ ການຈອງ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Engage fans</strong>: Add newsletter signup and match highlights to "
"your website to boost retention."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສ້າງຄວາມຜູກພັນກັບແຟນບານ</strong>: ເພີ່ມລະບົບສະໝັກຮັບຂ່າວສານ ແລະ "
"ໄຮໄລ້ການແຂ່ງຂັນໃສ່ເວັບໄຊ ເພື່ອຮັກສາຖານແຟນບານ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Keep sponsor data fresh</strong>: Use CRM activity templates for "
"scheduled check-ins or renewals."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ສະໜັບສະໜູນສະເໝີ</strong>: ໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບກິດຈະກຳ CRM ສຳລັບການຕິດຕໍ່ຕາມກຳນົດ "
"ຫຼື ການຕໍ່ສັນຍາ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Keep your eCommerce slick</strong>: Use bundled offers—e.g., season "
"pass + team kit—to drive value."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເພີ່ມຍອດຂາຍອອນລາຍ</strong>: ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ສະເໜີແບບຊຸດລວມ ເຊັ່ນ: ບັດປະຈຳລະດູການ + "
"ຊຸດແຂ່ງຂັນ ເພື່ອສ້າງມູນຄ່າເພີ່ມ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Marketing Automation</strong> to engage fans and sponsors over time."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລະບົບການຕະຫຼາດອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Marketing Automation)</strong> "
"ເພື່ອສ້າງການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມກັບແຟນບານ ແລະ ຜູ້ສະໜັບສະໜູນຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Membership/subscription services</strong> with recurring billing via "
"Recurring Invoices."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ບໍລິການສະມາຊິກ/ການລົງທະບຽນລາຍງວດ</strong> "
"ດ້ວຍການຮຽກເກັບເງິນແບບປະຈຳຜ່ານໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Recurring Invoices)."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Organize recruitment</strong>: Standardize evaluation forms in "
"Projects to compare prospects easily."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຈັດລະບຽບການຮັບສະໝັກ</strong>: ສ້າງແບບຟອມປະເມີນມາດຕະຖານໃນແອັບ Projects "
"ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບຄວາມສາມາດຂອງຜູ້ສະໝັກໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:event.event,description:team_sports_club.event_event_8
msgid "<strong>Pricing: 400 euros</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ລາຄາ: 400 ເອີໂຣ</strong>"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Promote events early</strong>: Link your Events app with your "
"website to boost ticket sales."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ປະຊາສຳພັນງານລ່ວງໜ້າ</strong>: ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແອັບ Events ເຂົ້າກັບເວັບໄຊເພື່ອເພີ່ມຍອດຂາຍປີ້."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>SMS Marketing</strong> for last-minute match alerts or ticket "
"promotions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານ SMS</strong> ສຳລັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການແຂ່ງຂັນດ່ວນ ຫຼື ໂປຣໂມຊັນປີ້ເຂົ້າຊົມ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Sign app</strong> to facilitate digital agreements with sponsors or "
"suppliers."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບ Sign</strong> ເພື່ອອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກໃນການເຊັນສັນຍາດິຈິຕອນກັບຜູ້ສະໜັບສະໜູນ ຫຼື "
"ຜູ້ສະໜອງສິນຄ້າ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Simplify bookings</strong>: Share Planning booking links with "
"members or locals to reduce admin overhead."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຫຼຸດຂັ້ນຕອນການຈອງ</strong>: ແບ່ງປັນລິ້ງການຈອງຈາກແອັບ Planning ໃຫ້ສະມາຊິກ ຫຼື "
"ບຸກຄົນທົ່ວໄປ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດພາລະວຽກເອກະສານ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_about_us
msgid "A New Home Stadium"
msgstr "ສະໜາມກິລາແຫ່ງໃໝ່ຂອງສະໂມສອນ"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"A commitment to continuous self-improvement, fostering a winning culture, "
"and demanding the best of oneself at every single training session."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມມຸ່ງໝັ້ນໃນການພັດທະນາຕົນເອງຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, ການສ້າງວັດທະນະທຳແຫ່ງໄຊຊະນະ, ແລະ "
"ການດຶງສັກກະຍະພາບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດຂອງຕົນເອງອອກມາໃນທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ລົງຝຶກຊ້ອມ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"A decisive goal in front of a packed stadium sealed our first championship "
"title."
msgstr "ປະຕູຕັດສິນຕໍ່ໜ້າກອງເຊຍເຕັມສະໜາມ ໄດ້ນຳພາສະໂມສອນຄວ້າແຊ້ມທຳອິດມາຄອງ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model:website.page,name:team_sports_club.page_about_us
msgid "About"
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບ"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model:product.public.category,name:team_sports_club.product_public_category_3
msgid "Accessories"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນເສີມ"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.x_player_search_view
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.x_staff_search_view
msgid "Active Team"
msgstr "ທີມທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວຢູ່"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model:product.template,name:team_sports_club.product_template_11
msgid "Additional Pack"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:team_sports_club.product_template_18
msgid "Adjustable baseball cap with embroidered club logo."
msgstr "ໝວກເບສບອນປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ ພ້ອມປັກໂລໂກ້ສະໂມສອນ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.view_page_cookie_policy
msgid "Advertising &amp; Marketing<br/>(optional)"
msgstr "ການໂຄສະນາ &amp; ການຕະຫຼາດ<br/>(ເລືອກໄດ້)"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.template_footer_mega_links
msgid "All Events"
msgstr "ງານກິດຈະກຳທັງໝົດ"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:event.event,description:team_sports_club.event_event_2
msgid "All ability levels welcome"
msgstr "ຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບທຸກລະດັບຄວາມສາມາດ"

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:team_sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid "Allow fans to enroll or register players for next season or camps."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຫ້ແຟນບານລົງທະບຽນ ຫຼື ລົງທະບຽນນັກເຕະສຳລັບລະດູການໜ້າ ຫຼື ຄ້າຍເຝິກອົບຮົມ."

#. module: team_sports_club
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:team_sports_club.product_template_15
msgid ""
"Alternate club jersey in a bold design for away games. Same quality and "
